  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_66324119-8baf-4354-9a58-844c56660631.png\"><br><br></strong></span><strong>請注意，這是一款<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">BETA</span> </span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">整合包</span>的早期版本。</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></span>因此您可能會遇到一些錯誤。<br><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/bcCqRpc4mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_61b19ee6-9bb9-4048-a1a9-259d3066028f.png\" width=\"436\" height=\"101\"></a><br></strong><br><br><strong>請在 CurseForge 中</strong>&nbsp;關閉&nbsp;<em>&ldquo;跳過 Mojang 啟動器&rdquo;</em>&nbsp;選項。<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><br>(可能導致問題)<br><br></span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>記憶體配置：<br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">- <strong>建議：8 GB</strong> -</span></strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_d057c668-4a7f-41d4-b475-ef00cbc2a9d7.png\"><br><br></span></h4>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Ascendra</strong> 是一款以<strong>探索、魔法與科技</strong>為核心的<strong>模組整合包</strong>。<br>深入充滿<strong>新維度、強大首領與大量新結構</strong>的世界吧。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Ascendra 擁有<strong>獨特的進度系統</strong>，不斷推動您向前邁進。<br>面對<strong>史詩級的全新首領</strong>，精通魔法、研發科技，並克服<strong>艱難的挑戰</strong>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Ascendra 也包含<strong>舒適放鬆的遊玩體驗</strong>，讓您能夠放慢腳步，<strong>建造</strong>、<strong>務農</strong>，並以自己的節奏享受<strong>這個世界</strong>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">憑藉<strong>440 多款模組</strong>、<strong>沉浸式任務</strong>以及<strong>全面重做的世界生成機制</strong>，<strong>Ascendra</strong> 為您帶來<strong>長期耐玩</strong>的遊戲體驗。</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>想要與朋友一起玩 Ascendra 嗎？<br><br></strong>我們推薦使用<strong>Wabbanode</strong>來進行<strong>穩定且流暢</strong>的伺服器託管。<strong><br></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fmagicsascension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_a9d16eb2-7307-4d60-a690-174c0321133c.png\" width=\"608\" height=\"122\"></a><br><br>也請<strong>考慮</strong>加入我們的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/bcCqRpc4mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord</strong></a>以<strong>獲取最新消息</strong>，或與<strong>社群</strong>互動。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_05c58146-2be5-4ca9-b8a7-65c816b1d486.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_7d68dfd9-981d-4d2e-8b38-e1c36c5a9f86.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_45061a24-11dd-476e-ad4c-3e14247620a4.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_5360af35-7341-4d93-8b2b-c35843914197.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_1f937e70-916a-4831-8e77-c1673045cecf.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_4ebfdec4-94e5-4bc1-97d4-e082b5978b71.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382025/description_a56357e1-e176-4032-9b3b-8191dd272ab6.png\"><br><br>🌍 </strong></span><strong>強化<span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"> </span></strong><strong>世界</strong>生成，擁有<strong>海量全新生物群系</strong>等待探索！<span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong><br><br></strong></span>⚔ 搭配<strong>Better Combat</strong>模組的<strong>強化戰鬥</strong>系統<br><br>🪄 <strong>學習魔法</strong>、<strong>施展法術</strong>並<strong>變得更強</strong>！<br><br>🏰 超過<strong>500 種結構</strong>等待探索！<br><br>🧑&zwj;🌾 使用<strong>Farmer&#39;s Delight</strong>烹飪美食<br><br>🛠 運用科技模組實現自動化！<br><br>💻<strong>優異效能</strong>，即使搭載 400 多款模組也能流暢運行</p>",
